message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PNT Score Predictor (discourse-to-pnt)"
abstract: >-
  A client-side web application that predicts Philadelphia Naming Test
  scores and error subtypes from a connected-speech discourse transcript,
  using sentence embeddings and regression models run entirely in-browser.
type: software
authors:
